
# Read Me

The purpose of this project is to practice writing comprehensive user documentation for a specific user demographic. The goal is to utilize Material for MKdocs to create documentation that makes use of admonitions, keyboard shortcuts, and images to better convey instructions to the user. By the end of the documentation, the user will have a foundational grasp on the most basic Figma concepts.

This project successfully demonstrates our ability to write clearly and concisely, work in a team, and break down complex topics into digestible instructions.  
